1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:28,000
And now to your scout master.

2
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:43,000
We sometimes find, because America is so big in our media and in our movies and everything, that people kind of assume that we're the same,

3
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:44,000
It gets really irritating.

4
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:53,000
What's even more irritating is when I speak to people and I say, yeah, but speaking with somebody from Scouts Australia, they have Scouts.

5
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:55,000
Yeah, they have Scouts.

6
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:57,000
It wasn't even invented by an American.

7
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:00,000
It wasn't invented by an Australian either.

8
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:06,000
This is podcast number 170.

9
